# Explainability

Example

Weighted Pull-Ups are selected because your sport requires repeated high-force pulling against resisting opponents.

Improving vertical pulling strength enhances grip fighting, clinch control, takedown performance and submission mechanics while maintaining excellent strength-to-bodyweight ratio.

